        </div>



    <div class="cmp-teaser__content">


    <h3 class="cmp-teaser__title">
        Our People Make Us Mortenson
      </h3>





    <div class="cmp-teaser__description"><p>Our people are what make us uniquely Mortenson – and we’re prioritizing diverse representation within our company and across our industry. Inspired by our founder, Mort Mortenson, who believed everyone has the potential to lead, we invest significantly in our team; focusing on creating a place where people want to stay and lead. LeadBLU, our approach to leadership and culture, represents how we differentiate and most importantly, our commitment to each other.&nbsp;</p>
</div>



