<div class="section aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-section " id="section-4e708540f1">


    <div class="cmp-section__container" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true">




<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="grid-container cmp-grid--site-width cmp-grid-container--2col-6 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-grid-container" id="grid-container-fa0106f216">


    <div class="cmp-grid-container__items">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="text cmp-text--padding-48 cmp-text--remove-bottom-padding aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-text" id="text-e8eda61cf3">
    <h2 data-gtm-vis-first-on-screen196163689_194="8032">The Soul of Mortenson</h2>
<p>Our story is highlighted by the "special sauce" that defines our authentic Mortenson culture – rooted in a longstanding approach to doing the right thing, putting we before me and inspiring what's possible.</p>
<p>Since our humble beginnings in 1954, as a small, family-owned construction company, Mortenson has grown into an industry leader and innovator, disrupting norms and improving outcomes. Our journey is a testament to the power of partnership and collaboration – and we don’t take it for granted. No matter the scale or scope of the project, everything we do makes us better. We are dedicated to revolutionizing the way we build, always with our customers, partners and team members at the heart of everything we do.</p>

</div>



</div>
